user/pipewire
Chimera main/pipewire/files/pipewire.user and Artix pipewire-dinit/
pipewire.user use distro-patched native notification. Stock Exherbo lacks it:
use pipewire-ready instead. No hard dbus dependency for core audio.

user/pipewire-pulse
Chimera main/pipewire/files/pipewire-pulse.user and Artix pipewire-dinit/
pipewire-pulse.user depend on PipeWire, not WirePlumber. Policy is separate.

user/wireplumber
Chimera main/wireplumber/files/wireplumber.user depends on PipeWire only.

